warming|General temperature increase fits gradual room heating; no unsupported global-climate claim. Vietnamese preserves heater timing and gradual change; process noun is distinct from the participial adjective.
driver|Operator meaning is not equated with all passengers. Seat-belt waiting scene preserves until and participants in Vietnamese without claiming a current legal rule.
homogeneous|Uniform or similar composition rather than absolute identical atoms is intended. Mixing instruction is descriptive and qualified by appearance; no fabricated scientific measurement or social stereotype.
indifferent|Lack of concern about restaurant choice is not dislike or hostility. Vietnamese keeps seemed uncertainty; to complement is appropriate and no temporal constraint is inferred.
radio|Physical receiver and sound broadcasting medium differentiated within the same broad Oxford group. Volume and future local interview contexts align; both countability and on relation reviewed without artificial tense splitting.
